#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The CGI KIO slave lets you execute local CGI programs without the need to "
"run a web server."
msgstr ""
"CGI KIO rob Vam omogućava da izvršavate CGI programe bez potrebe da "
"pokrecete server."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this system settings module you can configure the paths that are searched "
"for CGI scripts."
msgstr ""
"U ovim postavkama sistema mozete podesiti puteve koji se traze za CGI "
"skripte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Paths to CGI scripts are displayed in the list box at the bottom of this "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Putevi do CGI skripti su prikazani u tekstualnom prozoru na dnu ovog okvira."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the buttons below the list box to add or remove paths from the search."
msgstr "Koristite dugmad ispod liste da dodate ili uklonite put iz pretrage."
